---
import Project from "../components/Project.astro";
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Block from "../components/Block.astro";
---

<Base
    title = "buh / projects"
    description = "stuff i worked on that i feel good enough about to brag a little"
>
    <Block class="font-light text-2xl noborder">
        <h1 class="font-bold text-2xl md:text-3xl text-fancy pulp">buh works</h1>
        <p>This is a <span class="font-medium">non-exhaustive</span> list of my own projects that I worked on.</p>
        <p>I'd love for this to be longer and I have some great ideas cooking up, but currently I have to focus on making it through university.</p>
        <br>
        <p class="italic opacity-80">A bunch of my abandoned projects are too small to list here, like a custom catppuccin-based theme set or numerous custom Discord bots. You can see some of them on my GitHub.</p>
    </Block>


    <Project 
        title="AstralSeek"
        date="waiting..."
        tags={["C#", "Dalamud", "FFXIV"]}
        desc="A custom spotlight-like command bar plugin for FFXIV, kind of like Wotsit, which I find too cluttered. Semi-inspired by Raycast. The plan is to remake it once I'm more active."
    />

    <Project 
        title="picoCal"
        date="July 2026"
        tags={["Swift", "macOS"]}
        desc="A very simple Menu Bar calendar along the lines of Dottt, which was kind of dead back when I first started making it and wasn't receiving updates."
    />

    <Project 
        title="deadlock-widget"
        date="July 2026"
        tags={["Deadlock", "Discord", "Python", "OCR"]}
        desc="An OCR tool to update my Deadlock-themed Discord profile widget by automatically finding and reading a new screenshot of the stats page."
    />

    <Project 
        title="buh.moe"
        date="April 2026"
        url="https://github.com/amemoia/buh.moe"
        tags={["Design", "Astro", "Artwork"]}
        desc="You're looking at 'er now! I refresh the design of my website pretty regularly to reflect my interests. This design is the result of a lot of trial and error, but I like it a lot."
    />

    <Project 
        title="geggos.net"
        date="March 2026"
        url="https://geggos.net"
        tags={["Design", "Astro", "Pages CMS"]}
        desc="My friend was paying too much for a website, so I made a shiny new one from scratch and helped cut down on costs. Also hooked up Pages CMS for a blog post editor."
    />

    <Project 
        title="amemoia.nekoweb.org"
        date="January 2024"
        url="https://amemoia.nekoweb.org"
        tags={["HTML", "CSS", "JavaScript"]}
        desc="A website modeled after Needy Streamer Overload, as faithful to the game as possible. It's honestly horrible from a technical standpoint, but many people enjoyed it and somehow this page is what eventually got me into the Deadlock playtest not long after it leaked."
    />

</Base>